+| **[sanskrit_parser](https://github.com/kmadathil/sanskrit_parser)** | Sandhi splitting, lexical/grammatical analysis and dependency/karaka-related work, with explicit ambiguity and coverage limitations. | Study staged analysis and presentation of multiple interpretations for an optional research frontend. Natural-language segmentation should not silently change ordinary Sutram identifiers or program meaning. |
+| **[Sanskrit Heritage Engine](https://sanskrit.uohyd.ac.in/SKT/manual.html)** | Sanskrit morphological/segmentation analysis and a user interface for alternatives. | Study how to expose ambiguity and let the user select an interpretation in a grammar tool. Ordinary compilation should continue to follow one documented grammar with reproducible errors. |
